  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "租稅法(一)",
    "sub_ename": "TAX LAW(1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在解說我國的租稅法律規定，使學生對我國的租稅法律有一全盤而詳盡之瞭解。課程內容含括綜合所得稅、營利事業所得稅、最低稅負制、遺產贈與稅、土地稅、房屋稅、營業稅、貨物稅、菸酒稅、關稅、信託課稅以及稅捐稽徵法等。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to introduce and interpret Taiwan's tax law, so that the students have a comprehensive and detailed of the understanding of our country's tax laws . Curriculum encompasses a comprehensive income tax, business tax, alternative minimum tax, inheritance gift tax, land tax, property tax, sales tax, excise taxes, tobacco taxes, tariffs, trust taxation and tax collection law",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
